    "Hidden-test readability during grading could not be ruled out (see the isolation.hidden_test_readability check) \u2014 this finding is deliberately excluded from the status precedence (afa_integrity.health) because it is a constant, documented property of the current LocalSandbox threat model, not something this specific task can fix.",
